    {
      "id": "2ab14865-37ae-43a9-a558-8beaca107d70",
      "name": "Read the invoice image",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        6192,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are a precise invoice/receipt extraction agent. Analyze the provided image thoroughly and return STRICT JSON only (no extra text, no markdown, no code blocks). \n\nCRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Read the ENTIRE image content carefully. Extract ALL visible text and numbers. Do NOT skip any part of the image analysis.\n\nINPUT VARIABLES (from n8n):\n- pdf_filename = {{ $('Combine file and links').item.json.fileName }}\n- pdfUrl = {{ $('Combine file and links').item.json.pdfUrl }}\n- driveLink = {{ $('Combine file and links').item.json.driveLink }}\n\nMANDATORY OUTPUT FORMAT (return exactly these keys with exact spelling):\n{\n  \"company_name\": \"...\",\n  \"invoice_number\": \"...\",\n  \"invoice_date\": \"Month DD, YYYY or N/A\",\n  \"VAT_Tax\": \"amount with original currency symbol or N/A\",\n  \"sales_tax\": \"amount with original currency symbol or N/A\",\n  \"total_amount\": \"final payable amount with currency symbol or N/A\",\n  \"paid_status\": \"Paid or Unpaid or Pending or N/A\",\n  \"term\": \"payment terms or N/A\",\n  \"pdf_filename\": \"{{ $('Combine file and links').item.json.fileName }}\",\n  \"pdfUrl\": \"{{ $('Combine file and links').item.json.pdfUrl }}\",\n  \"driveLink\": \"{{ $('Combine file and links').item.json.driveLink }}\"\n}\n\nDETAILED EXTRACTION RULES:\n\n1) Company Name - MANDATORY EXTRACTION:\n   - Look at TOP of document, logo area, header section\n   - Find company issuing the invoice (Amazon, Flipkart, etc.)\n   - Check \"From:\", \"Seller:\", \"Billed by:\" sections\n   - Use the PRIMARY business name, ignore subsidiary names\n\n2) Invoice Number - SYSTEMATIC SEARCH:\n   - First priority: \"Invoice #\", \"Invoice No:\", \"Invoice Number:\"\n   - Second priority: \"Bill No:\", \"Bill Number:\", \"Receipt No:\"\n   - Third priority: \"Order #\", \"Order Number:\", \"Reference:\"\n   - Extract the COMPLETE number including prefixes/suffixes\n\n3) Invoice Date - COMPREHENSIVE DATE DETECTION:\n   - Look for \"Invoice Date:\", \"Date:\", \"Bill Date:\", \"Order Date:\"\n   - Accept ANY date format: DD/MM/YYYY, MM-DD-YYYY, DD-MMM-YYYY\n   - Convert to \"Month DD, YYYY\" (e.g., \"August 15, 2020\")\n   - If multiple dates, prefer \"Invoice Date\" over \"Order Date\"\n\n4) Tax Extraction - DETAILED ANALYSIS:\n   - VAT_Tax: Search for \"VAT\", \"GST\", \"IGST\", \"CGST\", \"SGST\", \"Value Added Tax\"\n   - sales_tax: Search for \"Sales Tax\", \"Tax\", \"Service Tax\" (US/general tax)\n   - Include currency symbol: $, ₹, €, £, etc.\n   - If only one tax type exists, put in appropriate field, set other to \"N/A\"\n\n5) Total Amount - PRIORITY HIERARCHY:\n   - Priority 1: \"Amount Due\", \"Balance Due\", \"Total Due\"\n   - Priority 2: \"Grand Total\", \"Final Total\", \"Net Total\"\n   - Priority 3: \"Total Amount\", \"Total\", \"Payable Amount\"\n   - Use HIGHEST priority available, include full currency formatting\n\n6) Paid Status - COMPREHENSIVE DETECTION:\n   - \"Paid\": Look for \"PAID\", \"PAID IN FULL\", \"Payment Received\", \"Completed\"\n   - \"Paid\": Also if \"Amount Due: $0.00\" or \"Balance: 0\"\n   - \"Unpaid\": Positive amount in \"Amount Due\" or explicit \"UNPAID\"\n   - \"Pending\": \"Pending Payment\", \"Processing\", \"Awaiting Payment\"\n   - Default: \"N/A\" if no clear indicators\n\n7) Payment Terms:\n   - Search for: \"Terms:\", \"Payment Terms:\", \"Net 30\", \"Net 15\", \"Due in\"\n   - Look for: \"Due on receipt\", \"Payment due by\", \"Due within X days\"\n   - Extract exactly as written in document\n\n8) Variable Assignment:\n   - ALWAYS include the three n8n variables exactly as provided\n   - Never modify or omit these variables\n\nPROCESSING INSTRUCTIONS:\n\nSTEP 1: Scan the ENTIRE image systematically from top to bottom\nSTEP 2: Identify if this is an invoice/receipt (must have financial elements)\nSTEP 3: Extract each field using the priority rules above  \nSTEP 4: Verify all currency symbols and amounts are preserved exactly\nSTEP 5: Format the JSON response with proper string values\n\nCRITICAL SUCCESS FACTORS:\n- Read EVERY piece of text in the image\n- Never assume or skip content\n- Preserve exact formatting of numbers and currency\n- Use consistent field extraction methodology\n- Return valid JSON with NO additional text\n\nFAILURE CONDITIONS:\n- If clearly NOT an invoice/receipt (no financial data), return blank response\n- If image is completely unreadable, extract whatever is visible\n\nOUTPUT REQUIREMENT: Return ONLY the JSON object, nothing else.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert at analyzing images of invoices, receipts, and bills. You can read text from images and extract structured data accurately."
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
